id=MicroG_Flasher
name=MicroG Flasher
version=v0.1.0
versionCode=1
author=anshlabs716
description=Actually flashes microG. Downloads the latest official, signed microG apks (GmsCore + FakeStore) straight from the microG GitHub releases at install time, and installs them systemlessly as privileged system apps with the right permission allowlists. Requires a ROM with (microG) signature spoofing support - most custom ROMs since 2024 have it built in.
